            <li>Ukuphuma kwento enevumba elibi esithweni sangasese</li>
            <li>Umkhuhlane ongaphezu kwe-38°C</li>
            <li>Inxeba lokuhlinzwa elibomvu, elishushu, okanye eliphuma ubomvu</li>
            <li>Iingcinga ezingapheliyo zokuzenzakalisa okanye ukwenzakalisa usana</li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
